- CurrentReleaseResponse (with JsonNode snapshot)

Need import for JsonNode in ApiDtos: com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.JsonNode.

For CurrentReleaseResponse: `record CurrentReleaseResponse(long documentId, int releaseRevision, Integer publishedVersion, JsonNode snapshot)`. When never published/all withdrawn: publishedVersion null, snapshot null. Default Jackson includes nulls → "publishedVersion": null, "snapshot": null. Good, requirement says 快照null.

WithdrawResponse: `(long documentId, int publishedVersion, int releaseRevision, boolean withdrawn, String withdrawnAt)` — withdrawnAt ISO UTC string.

ReleaseEntryView: `(int publishedVersion, boolean withdrawn, String withdrawReason, String withdrawnAt)`.
ReleaseCatalogResponse: `(long documentId, int releaseRevision, List<ReleaseEntryView> releases)`.

PublishResponse: add releaseRevision? Requirement doesn't demand it, but "每篇文档新增发布目录修订号…后续每次成功发布…加一" — exposing it in publish response is useful for clients to then call withdraw with expectedReleaseRevision. Otherwise clients must GET catalog first. I'll add `releaseRevision` to PublishResponse. Existing tests don't assert absence of fields, fine.

Then service methods:

```java
